      <div type="clause" n="16[a]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 16[a]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif he smeawyrhtan hæfð . ðam he sceal to tolan fylstan . Mylewerde, Sutere . Leodgotan. 7 oðran wyrhtan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he has skilled artisans, he must supply tools to them, miller, shoe maker, plumber and other workers.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[16[a]]] And gif he smeawyrhtan hæfð, ðam he sceal to tolan fylstan: mylewerde, sutere, leodgotan 7 oðran wyrhtan –</ab>
